### Iconator API — VS Code REST Client
###
### Start the server first:  cargo run   (binds 0.0.0.0:3000 by default,
### overridable via HOST / PORT in .env / .env.local)
###
### Base64 values below are URL-safe and unpadded (what the HTML page itself
### generates). The server also accepts the standard alphabet with padding.
###
### usage: click "Send Request" above each request; requires the VS Code
### REST Client extension (humao.rest-client)

@host = http://localhost:3000

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Health
### expect: 200 {"status":"ok"}

GET {{host}}/health

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### File lookups (expect 200 {"icon_id": 525} — library test vector)

### base64 of "src/main.rs" (unpadded; same in standard and URL-safe alphabets)
GET {{host}}/api/icon/file?path=c3JjL21haW4ucnM

### Standard padded base64 of "src/main.rs" — the other accepted alphabet
GET {{host}}/api/icon/file?path=c3JjL21haW4ucnM=

###".gitignore" is in the filename table → icon 206
GET {{host}}/api/icon/file?path=LmdpdGlnbm9yZQ

###"weird name #?.rs" — every character hostile in a query string
GET {{host}}/api/icon/file?path=d2VpcmQgbmFtZSAjPy5ycw

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Folder lookups (expect 200 {"icon_id": 862} — library test vector)

### base64 of ".github"
GET {{host}}/api/icon/folder?path=LmdpdGh1Yg

### base64 of "node_modules"
GET {{host}}/api/icon/folder?path=bm9kZV9tb2R1bGVz

### base64 of "src"
GET {{host}}/api/icon/folder?path=c3Jj

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Lookup misses — expect 404 {"error": "no icon found"}

### unknown extension
GET {{host}}/api/icon/file?path=dW5rbm93bi54eXo

### "LICENSE": unknown extensionless filename — library panics, server maps it to 404
GET {{host}}/api/icon/file?path=TElDRU5TRQ

### "foo/..": path without a file name — same panic-safety path
GET {{host}}/api/icon/file?path=Zm9vLy4u
GET {{host}}/api/icon/folder?path=Zm9vLy4u

### unknown folder
GET {{host}}/api/icon/folder?path=ZGVmaW5pdGVseS1ub3QtYS1rbm93bi1mb2xkZXI

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Bad requests — expect 400

### missing `path` entirely → {"error": "missing required query parameter 'path'"}
GET {{host}}/api/icon/file

### empty `path` → missing-path error
GET {{host}}/api/icon/file?path=

### base64 of an empty string → missing-path error
GET {{host}}/api/icon/folder?path====

### plain (non-base64) path → {"error": "invalid base64 in query parameter 'path'"}
GET {{host}}/api/icon/file?path=src/main.rs

### base64 that decodes to non-UTF-8 bytes → invalid-base64 error
GET {{host}}/api/icon/file?path=/w==

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Method check — expect 405

POST {{host}}/api/icon/file?path=c3JjL21haW4ucnM
content-type: application/json

{}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### SVG assets

### expect 200, image/svg+xml
GET {{host}}/icons/525.svg

### expect 200 (folder icon for .github)
GET {{host}}/icons/862.svg

### expect 404 (ServeDir default)
GET {{host}}/icons/999999.svg

### path traversal is rejected by ServeDir — expect 404
GET {{host}}/icons/../Cargo.toml

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### HTML UI

### index page: lookup form + icon grid — expect 200 text/html
GET {{host}}/

### submitted form state: plain path + kind, result rendered inline
GET {{host}}/?path=src/main.rs&kind=file

### miss path: page still 200, "no icon found" message rendered
GET {{host}}/?path=unknown.xyz&kind=file

### folder kind via the form
GET {{host}}/?path=.github&kind=folder
